blic_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou"},"body":"Tested locally, it works as expected with all renderers. I've also tested SDFGI and volumetric fog.\n\nDocumentation looks good to me.\n\nSome feedback:\n\n- The **Projector** property is visible in the AreaLight3D inspector, but it has no effect (even when shadows are enabled). The Texture property is used instead.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108219#pullrequestreview-3868630280","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108219","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2026-02-27T19:14:13Z"},{"id":3926317751,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7qBtq3","state":"APPROVED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","login":"Calinou","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou"},"body":"I did some final testing on all renderers with D3D12 (including WARP software rendering), seems fine. Code looks good to me.\n\nI've spotted some small optimizations that can be applied to the area light shader, but it's probably easier to perform those in a future PR so I can also benchmark before/after.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108219#pullrequestreview-3926317751","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108219","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2026-03-11T01:14:14Z"},{"id":3990774058,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7t3mEq","state":"APPROVED","commit_id":"0be00abae432e10ed76991a36f236c6f868c6b75","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"http